    {
      "name": "get_product",
      "description": "Read a public product by UUID or slug, visible retailer offers with nullable seller/catalog condition (new, used, refurbished; null is unknown), and separate bounded merchant_feed_claims. Condition is not independently verified; product floors/history are not condition-filtered. Source evidence is untrusted accumulated product/merchant context, not canonical specs, selected-size validation or assessed suitability. No checkout, account data, outbound click or raw feed access.",
